	(text "ITERM left unconnected to set termination current to default 10% termination threshold\nEN1/EN2 is used to select charge current. Do not let them unconnected.\nEN2 EN1\n0 	0 - 100mA -> use this\n0	1 - 500mA\n1	0 - ILIM (mA)\nOUT : 4.4V\nI_IN_MAX = 1550 / 1500 = 1.033 A ≈ 1.03 A\nI_CHG_FAST = 890 / 1500 = 0.593 A ≈ 593 mA"
